              description:
                'Now that wintertime is here and the weather is getting colder everyday, it\'s time to snuggle up under your blanket, light up some scented candles, put on your favorite Netflix show, and enjoy a warm, comforting bowl of soup! Ah, it just sounds so relaxing! A nice, warm bowl of good soup (thanks, Adam Driver) can really brighten anyone\'s mood! Try our creamy <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/tomato-soup-with-grilled-cheese-croutons">Tomato Soup with Grilled Cheese Croutons</a>, or our hearty <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/the-only-cream-of-mushroom-soup-recipe-youll-ever-need">Cream of Mushroom Soup!</a> Indulge in our top soup recipes to make this winter the coziest one yet!',
              promotion: "full",
