              description:
                "We've curated some 'avo-rable' recipes for all green goddesses out there because, well, avocados never go out of style! Kick off your morning with a hearty and healthy <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/baked-avocado-eggs\n\">Cheddar & Chive Avocado Egg</a>. If you want to spruce things up, test out a nutrient-packed <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/avocado-quinoa-power-salad\">Avocado Quinoa Power Salad</a>. We've got just the right recipes to celebrate everyone's favorite green superfood (don't worry, we won't tell kale if you won't). ",
